OL,3,GNEWSAMural marks epic battle that
OL,4,Ahelped forge US Navy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new mural depicting one of the most
OL,7,Fcelebrated naval battles in US history
OL,8,Fhas been painted close to where it was
OL,9,Ffought on the Yorkshire coast.
OL,11,FThe artwork, in Bridlington, portrays
OL,12,Fthe Battle of Flamborough Head, an epic
OL,13,Fencounter between the US and Royal
OL,14,Fnavies during the American
OL,15,FRevolutionary War.
OL,17,FIt captures the USS Bonhomme Richard
OL,18,Fand the frigate HMS Serapis locked in
OL,19,Fcombat beneath Bempton Cliffs on 23
OL,20,FSeptember 1779.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
