OL,3,GNEWSAMural marks epic battle that
OL,4,Ahelped forge US Navy
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtist Sam Porter, of Mural Minded,
OL,7,Fsaid: "I'm hoping that people will be
OL,8,Finspired by it. That's really the
OL,9,Fultimate aim, that you put a smile on
OL,10,Fpeople's faces and they're interested
OL,11,Fby it."
